## Bundled Fonts

The TTF fonts in `static/fonts/` are used for PDF rendering. All are licensed under the
**SIL Open Font License (OFL)** or **Apache 2.0**, both of which permit free use,
modification, and redistribution — including in commercial applications — provided the
font names are not sold standalone.

| Font | License |
