## External Services

This project **optionally** integrates with external APIs. These services are not bundled
with this software and are governed entirely by their own terms of service. The author has
no affiliation with these services and is not responsible for their availability, pricing,
or policy changes.

| Service | Purpose | Terms |
|---|---|---|
| Google Gemini API | AI features (summarize, chat, compare, etc.) | [Google AI Terms](https://ai.google.dev/terms) |
| Groq API | Optional AI fallback | [Groq Terms](https://groq.com/terms-of-service/) |
| Google Translate (via deep-translator) | Document translation | [Google Terms](https://policies.google.com/terms) |

- API keys are **your own** and are never stored in this repository.
- You are responsible for any usage costs or quota limits on your API accounts.
- The author is not liable for any service outages, billing issues, or data handling by these third-party providers.

